+### Behavior
+
+When enabled on a supported vehicle, a dedicated radar map process tracks traffic ahead and alongside for the cluster. The cluster keeps the confirmed vehicle type when the same vehicle moves from a front side slot to a rear slot. The cluster falls back to the existing display if map messages are late or stop.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END BEHAVIOR -->
